    plus one normal spell of the character''s level or lower. Only the normal
    half is granted: spells_starting 2 gated to levels 1-3, and one per level
    with spells_per_level_levels up_to_character_level, which expresses "of the
    same or lower level as the character" exactly. The temporal half has nowhere
    to go - the catalog holds 607 spells and NOT ONE of them is temporal magic;
    a search for Rifts England as a source book returns zero rows, and the five
    time-flavoured spells it does hold (Time Slip, Time Hole, Time Capsule and
    two Ley Line Time spells) are ordinary invocations from the Book of Magic
    and Palladium Fantasy, not the temporal list. A spell group with a note and
    no gate would have offered the whole catalog for a pick the book restricts
    to a list this machine does not have, which is the near-miss F7 warns
    against; granting nothing and saying so is the smaller error. Recorded on
    the Temporal Magic ability so the player sees it at the table.
  - NO PSIONICS BLOCK, AND THAT IS CORRECT. The entry says time masters "have
    all the normal abilities of their race, plus" magic - it grants no psionics
    of its own, so the First Stage Promethean''s block is the whole of it and
    composition has nothing to discard. This class is the one of the three
    O.C.C.s in this batch that F10 does not touch.
  - Phase powers are likewise the race''s: a time master may spend up to four of
    his R.C.C. related picks on temporal spells or phase powers, and that trade
    is recorded on the race rather than here.
  - MILITARY IS AN EXCLUSION, NOT A ZERO BONUS. The related list prints
    "Military: None", so the category is omitted from the list entirely rather
    than listed with no percentage - the second reading would offer the class
    twenty-one skills its book bars, and the OCR renders the two identically.
  - Attribute requirements: I.Q. and M.E. 12 or higher. There is no Alignment
    line on this entry at all, unlike the Phase Adept''s and the Phase Mystic''s,
    so none is recorded.
