## Lore

About one percent of the promethean race dedicate themselves fully to the study
of temporal magic. These mages are greatly respected throughout the Three
Galaxies and in many places of the Megaverse, and their command of sorcery
coupled with their natural phase powers makes them dangerous enemies. Half of
them become temporal wizards, as described in Rifts England. The other half are
time masters: adventurers and explorers who try to discover the innermost
secrets of the universe.

According to several legends the prometheans learned temporal magic from
fourth-dimensional beings like the mysterious god Zurvan. However they came by
it, promethean time masters do not learn spells the way a temporal wizard or
warrior does. They undergo rituals of advancement in the manner of a mystic or a
warlock, and some occultists hold that a time master simply is a warlock whose
"element" is time. So far no member of any other race has managed to establish a
mystic link with the timestream.

## Temporal Magic

The temporal spells a time master knows come from the list in Rifts England,
which this catalog does not hold - no row in it cites that book. Two are known
at first level and one more is gained at every level after, alongside the normal
spell the app does grant. Choose them from the book at the table; nothing here
will offer them, and nothing here will stop you.

## GM Notes

The link to the timestream costs the character his peace of mind. Roll once on
the phobia or obsession table on Rifts p.20 at creation. Time masters cannot
teach their spells to wizards, which is a large part of why temporal magic
remains rare: only the few prometheans who become true temporal wizards and
warriors can teach it at all.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'promethean-time-master');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'promethean-time-master';

